# Keep this folder limited to the shared, canonical dev files.
# Ignore everything by default...
*
# ...then re-include the files that SHOULD be tracked:
!.gitignore
!README.md
!.env.example
!docker-compose.kafka-local.yml
!docker-compose.postgres.yml
!docker-compose.swtsw.yml
!db-example/
db-example/*
!db-example/*.dump

# As a result, your personal files stay local and out of git:
#   - .env
#   - docker-compose.*.yml          (any personal subset/override copies)
